                        ],
                        "form": "resurfaces"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5245630e-bb69-4346-a669-023bce180e19",
                        "entry_id": "1279f005-4f67-3c77-b918-cc9d3e1c01d9",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "present"
                        ],
                        "form": "resurfacing"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b34db53f-711e-40cf-b305-07118b73916d",
                        "entry_id": "1279f005-4f67-3c77-b918-cc9d3e1c01d9",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "resurfaced"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "70a6c9ac-480e-400f-a465-d93c78817461",
                        "entry_id": "1279f005-4f67-3c77-b918-cc9d3e1c01d9",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "resurfaced"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "baf5be30-76cf-3f13-80cd-5d91af7fb9a2",
                        "entry_id": "1279f005-4f67-3c77-b918-cc9d3e1c01d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To come once again to the surface."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dcf9edf6-e0da-48ba-b091-7c75274076ac",
                                "sense_id": "baf5be30-76cf-3f13-80cd-5d91af7fb9a2",
                                "text": "His body finally resurfaced after three years underwater."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5fa2b658-930c-3b47-aaba-e8c9041c47da",
                        "entry_id": "1279f005-4f67-3c77-b918-cc9d3e1c01d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To surface again; to reappear or re-occur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "intransitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b33f8492-df63-4244-9db7-c574786fe172",
                                "sense_id": "5fa2b658-930c-3b47-aaba-e8c9041c47da",
                                "text": "Just as amazing, gruesome morgue photos of some of the madman's street-walker victims also resurfaced after being missing for decades."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f03ef857-6d6f-4d83-a8cd-7f156257ea78",
                                "sense_id": "5fa2b658-930c-3b47-aaba-e8c9041c47da",
                                "text": "Subplots that might have been fun to explore were relegated or eventually sidelined altogether in the case of characters like Gendry, who disappeared for years and finally resurfaces as a blacksmith in King’s Landing, literally waiting for the call to his hero’s journey."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88f8d13e-26b2-4fb6-8bd7-569f0af05689",
                                "sense_id": "5fa2b658-930c-3b47-aaba-e8c9041c47da",
                                "text": "The people in hiding now resurfaced in large numbers […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c072d5c-b694-4ef4-98e5-8bccedba4691",
                                "sense_id": "5fa2b658-930c-3b47-aaba-e8c9041c47da",
                                "text": "The Landguard Road overbridge to the south has subsequently been removed, although aspirations to reopen the four-mile route to Ventnor resurface from time to time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a045bd2f-ad50-42c5-afb8-4d45ab8ac371",
                                "sense_id": "5fa2b658-930c-3b47-aaba-e8c9041c47da",
                                "text": "Anonymity lies at the center of the mythology surrounding the elusive street artist Banksy, but he may have revealed his name in a resurfaced interview."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4df69b9d-9d2c-3dd9-bc22-00e689da3a2b",
                        "entry_id": "1279f005-4f67-3c77-b918-cc9d3e1c01d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make something reappear."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac5081fc-051b-4fc9-848f-8e950c23176a",
                                "sense_id": "4df69b9d-9d2c-3dd9-bc22-00e689da3a2b",
                                "text": "Tourian's poem exhibits a central strand of the Catholic tradition which has been suppressed in Armenian religious life but needs to be resurfaced."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99a58457-4d1e-4e59-8b62-e17246d1d367",
                                "sense_id": "4df69b9d-9d2c-3dd9-bc22-00e689da3a2b",
                                "text": "Hajjar said the initial idea was to resurface retro holiday sweaters, typically featuring reindeer and Christmas trees."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32cd3818-0116-470d-acf1-dc4c1b093b98",
                                "sense_id": "4df69b9d-9d2c-3dd9-bc22-00e689da3a2b",
                                "text": "Before coronavirus shuttered the world, a typical month for Connecticut native Zac Mathias was packed with appointments for microneedling (a collagen-stimulating process that involves repeated pin-pricks all over the face), regular resurfacing hydrafacials, rejuvenating laser treatments and the occasional red-light therapy session."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e3434d96-930f-3d1f-b1a3-f40020cd0126",
                        "entry_id": "1279f005-4f67-3c77-b918-cc9d3e1c01d9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To provide a new surface, to replace or remodel the surface of something, or to restore a surface. To put a new coating or finish on a surface."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e005e1c6-6ecd-49f8-9b38-b08a72a17b42",
                                "sense_id": "e3434d96-930f-3d1f-b1a3-f40020cd0126",
                                "text": "A zamboni is a big machine that resurfaces ice at a rink so it is smooth as glass for the skaters."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dd947fb-5ef6-4528-8ca9-c65eb04eafc8",
                                "sense_id": "e3434d96-930f-3d1f-b1a3-f40020cd0126",
                                "text": "Both platforms are being resurfaced, and work will take place to improve stepping distances between the platforms and trains."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "81180201-d260-43ca-a0ba-c4f9b352ec80",
                        "source_entry_id": "1279f005-4f67-3c77-b918-cc9d3e1c01d9",
